{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MSMFF3htx2qkEdeMzLtzw8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"full_study_clause_generation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"生成剩余140条clause pairs，达到300条（50/type × 6 types）。 验证跨类型平衡、CP混合格式、质量一致性。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"total_clauses_generated\": 300,\n7\t      \"new_clauses\": 140,\n8\t      \"per_type_count\": 50,\n9\t      \"format_mix_cp_labeled_pct\": 0.6,\n10\t      \"format_mix_cp_unlabeled_pct\": 0.4,\n11\t      \"avg_token_delta_spec_layer\": 35.2,\n12\t      \"avg_token_delta_ling_layer\": 14.8,\n13\t      \"quality_review_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n14\t      \"clauses_requiring_revision\": 12\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"name\": \"Clause Generation Summary\",\n19\t        \"columns\": [\n20\t          \"type\",\n21\t          \"layer\",\n22\t          \"n_pairs\",\n23\t          \"avg_token_delta\",\n24\t          \"revision_needed\"\n25\t        ],\n26\t        \"rows\": [\n27\t          [\n28\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n29\t            \"spec\",\n30\t            50,\n31\t            36.1,\n32\t            3\n33\t          ],\n34\t          [\n35\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n36\t            \"spec\",\n37\t            50,\n38\t            31.4,\n39\t            1\n40\t          ],\n41\t          [\n42\t            \"incompleteness\",\n43\t            \"spec\",\n44\t            50,\n45\t            34.6,\n46\t            4\n47\t          ],\n48\t          [\n49\t            \"lexical\",\n50\t            \"ling\",\n51\t            50,\n52\t            18.2,\n53\t            2\n54\t          ],\n55\t          [\n56\t            \"coreferential\",\n57\t            \"ling\",\n58\t            50,\n59\t            7.8,\n60\t            1\n61\t          ],\n62\t          [\n63\t            \"scopal\",\n64\t            \"ling\",\n65\t            50,\n66\t            18.3,\n67\t            1\n68\t          ]\n69\t        ]\n70\t      }\n71\t    ],\n72\t    \"figures\": [],\n73\t    \"analysis\": \"Clause generation成功完成。spec-layer token delta显著高于ling-layer（mean 34.0 vs 14.8, t-test p<0.001），这是结构性的——消除auth_scope模糊需要指定具体权限边界，消除incompleteness 需要补充缺失条件。plan_004 analysis中需将token_delta作为covariate控制。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下clause generation本身不是瓶颈——这是确定性工作。300条全部完成，但token delta 的spec/ling不对称（spec ~35 tokens vs ling ~15 tokens）会在后续analysis中成为reviewer 关注点（RC7 information asymmetry）。~8%的clause需要revision主要集中在auth_scope和 incompleteness，因为这两类需要在\\\"足够模糊以触发violation\\\"和\\\"不引入额外information asymmetry\\\" 之间平衡。CP混合格式（60% labeled + 40% unlabeled）按reviewer建议执行，不会出问题。\\n\"\n74\t  },\n75\t  {\n76\t    \"name\": \"new_type_mini_pilot\",\n77\t    \"description\": \"Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot验证。 5 clauses/type × 2 conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\\n\",\n78\t    \"results\": {\n79\t      \"total_episodes\": 20,\n80\t      \"auth_scope_amb_violation_rate\": 0.6,\n81\t      \"auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.1,\n82\t      \"coref_amb_violation_rate\": 0.2,\n83\t      \"coref_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.0,\n84\t      \"systematic_issues_found\": 1,\n85\t      \"issue_description\": \"2/5 auth_scope unambiguous clauses仍含residual boundary ambiguity，violation rate偏高\"\n86\t    },\n87\t    \"tables\": [\n88\t      {\n89\t        \"name\": \"Mini-pilot Results\",\n90\t        \"columns\": [\n91\t          \"type\",\n92\t          \"condition\",\n93\t          \"n\",\n94\t          \"violation_rate\",\n95\t          \"pass_threshold\"\n96\t        ],\n97\t        \"rows\": [\n98\t          [\n99\t            \"auth_scope\",\n100\t            \"ambiguous\",\n101\t            5,\n102\t            \"3/5 (60%)\",\n103\t            \"✓\"\n104\t          ],\n105\t          [\n106\t            \"auth_scope\",\n107\t            \"unambiguous\",\n108\t            5,\n109\t            \"0.5/5 (10%)\",\n110\t            \"✓ (marginal)\"\n111\t          ],\n112\t          [\n113\t            \"coreferential\",\n114\t            \"ambiguous\",\n115\t            5,\n116\t            \"1/5 (20%)\",\n117\t            \"✓\"\n118\t          ],\n119\t          [\n120\t            \"coreferential\",\n121\t            \"unambiguous\",\n122\t            5,\n123\t            \"0/5 (0%)\",\n124\t            \"✓\"\n125\t          ]\n126\t        ]\n127\t      }\n128\t    ],\n129\t    \"figures\": [],\n130\t    \"analysis\": \"Mini-pilot通过，两个新类型验证可行。Auth_scope unambiguous baseline 10%在阈值内（<15%） 但提示需要收紧permission boundary定义。修复2条clause后进入full study。N=20 power极低， 仅作sanity check用。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下mini-pilot发现auth_scope的unambiguous baseline偏高（10% vs target <15%但不理想）， 因为2条unambiguous clause的permission boundary仍有subtle残余模糊。这需要revision但不阻塞 进度——属于expected的clause quality iteration。Coreferential表现符合预期（amb 20%低于其他类型， unamb 0%干净），验证了coreferential作为\\\"low tier\\\"的定位。整体结论：两个新类型可用，但auth_scope 需要更严格的unambiguous control设计。\\n\"\n131\t  },\n132\t  {\n133\t    \"name\": \"full_study_api\",\n134\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6) = 1,800 episodes。Cross-judge evaluation。\\n\",\n135\t    \"results\": {\n136\t      \"total_episodes\": 1800,\n137\t      \"episodes_valid\": 1793,\n138\t      \"episodes_failed\": 7,\n139\t      \"failure_rate\": 0.004,\n140\t      \"overall_amb_violation_rate\": 0.383,\n141\t      \"overall_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.058,\n142\t      \"overall_delta_pp\": 32.5,\n143\t      \"gpt54_amb_rate\": 0.405,\n144\t      \"gpt54_unamb_rate\": 0.055,\n145\t      \"gpt54_delta_pp\": 35.0,\n146\t      \"gpt41_amb_rate\": 0.397,\n147\t      \"gpt41_unamb_rate\": 0.06,\n148\t      \"gpt41_delta_pp\": 33.7,\n149\t      \"claude_amb_rate\": 0.293,\n150\t      \"claude_unamb_rate\": 0.043,\n151\t      \"claude_delta_pp\": 25.0,\n152\t      \"cross_judge_agreement_kappa\": 0.88,\n153\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 340,\n154\t      \"runtime_hours\": 18\n155\t    },\n156\t    \"tables\": [\n157\t      {\n158\t        \"name\": \"Per-model Summary (API models)\",\n159\t        \"columns\": [\n160\t          \"model\",\n161\t          \"n_episodes\",\n162\t          \"amb_rate\",\n163\t          \"unamb_rate\",\n164\t          \"delta_pp\",\n165\t          \"mcnemar_p\"\n166\t        ],\n167\t        \"rows\": [\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"gpt-5.4\",\n170\t            600,\n171\t            0.405,\n172\t            0.055,\n173\t            35.0,\n174\t            \"<1e-20\"\n175\t          ],\n176\t          [\n177\t            \"gpt-4.1\",\n178\t            600,\n179\t            0.397,\n180\t            0.06,\n181\t            33.7,\n182\t            \"<1e-18\"\n183\t          ],\n184\t          [\n185\t            \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n186\t            600,\n187\t            0.293,\n188\t            0.043,\n189\t            25.0,\n190\t            \"<1e-14\"\n191\t          ]\n192\t        ]\n193\t      }\n194\t    ],\n195\t    \"figures\": [],\n196\t    \"analysis\": \"三个API模型全部显示显著binary effect。Claude最robust（最低amb rate + 最低delta），GPT-5.4 最vulnerable。Cross-judge κ=0.88表面良好，但plan_009将检验这是否反映true accuracy。 Claude via OpenRouter proxy运行稳定，延迟较直接API高~2x但不影响结果。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下full study API结果大体与prior数据一致，但存在两个关键偏差：(1) Claude的delta 从prior的25.7pp略降至~25pp（50 clauses per type的full coverage暴露了更多unambiguous baseline noise），(2) cross-judge agreement κ=0.88看似很高，但这是LLM-LLM agreement， plan_009会揭示这掩盖了共享的systematic bias。Overall delta 32.5pp比prior 34.0pp略低， 因为full 300 clauses包含了pilot中未覆盖的harder cases。7个episodes失败源于API timeout 和τ²-bench环境偶发错误，不影响统计。\\n\"\n197\t  },\n198\t  {\n199\t    \"name\": \"full_study_opensource\",\n200\t    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-v3) via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\\n\",\n201\t    \"results\": {\n202\t      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n203\t      \"episodes_valid\": 1188,\n204\t      \"episodes_failed\": 12,\n205\t      \"failure_rate\": 0.01,\n206\t      \"qwen3_amb_rate\": 0.421,\n207\t      \"qwen3_unamb_rate\": 0.063,\n208\t      \"qwen3_delta_pp\": 35.8,\n209\t      \"deepseek_amb_rate\": 0.487,\n210\t      \"deepseek_unamb_rate\": 0.067,\n211\t      \"deepseek_delta_pp\": 42.0,\n212\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 180,\n213\t      \"runtime_hours\": 14\n214\t    },\n215\t    \"tables\": [\n216\t      {\n217\t        \"name\": \"Per-model Summary (Open-source)\",\n218\t        \"columns\": [\n219\t          \"model\",\n220\t          \"n_episodes\",\n221\t          \"amb_rate\",\n222\t          \"unamb_rate\",\n223\t          \"delta_pp\",\n224\t          \"mcnemar_p\"\n225\t        ],\n226\t        \"rows\": [\n227\t          [\n228\t            \"qwen3-235b\",\n229\t            600,\n230\t            0.421,\n231\t            0.063,\n232\t            35.8,\n233\t            \"<1e-17\"\n234\t          ],\n235\t          [\n236\t            \"deepseek-v3\",\n237\t            600,\n238\t            0.487,\n239\t            0.067,\n240\t            42.0,\n241\t            \"<1e-22\"\n242\t          ]\n243\t        ]\n244\t      }\n245\t    ],\n246\t    \"figures\": [],\n247\t    \"analysis\": \"Open-source模型binary effect同样massive。DeepSeek的uniform high vulnerability pattern 是C4 interaction story的重要一极——与Claude的selective vulnerability形成鲜明对比。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下open-source模型通过OpenRouter API运行，failure rate略高于proprietary（1% vs 0.4%），主要因OpenRouter对Qwen3的routing偶发超时。DeepSeek展示最高overall vulnerability （48.7% amb rate），与prior一致——其safety training相对薄弱，6类型间差异小（uniform vulnerability pattern）。Qwen3中等偏高（42.1%），incompleteness和lexical是其弱项。两个open-source模型的 unambiguous baseline都略高于API模型（~6.5% vs ~5.3%），反映open-source模型在非模糊条件下 也有更多baseline violations——这在correction后会稍微压缩delta。12个failed episodes中8个是 Qwen3（长context下偶发truncation），4个是DeepSeek timeout。\\n\"\n248\t  },\n249\t  {\n250\t    \"name\": \"full_study_analysis\",\n251\t    \"description\": \"Full statistical analysis of 2,997 episodes across 5 models × 6 types × 2 conditions。 包含C1 binary effect, C2 type hierarchy, C3 layer effect, C4 model×type interaction, TOST equivalence, power analysis, logistic regression。\\n\",\n252\t    \"results\": {\n253\t      \"c1_overall_delta_pp\": 33.5,\n254\t      \"c1_mcnemar_or\": 14.2,\n255\t      \"c1_or_ci\": [\n256\t        10.1,\n257\t        20.0\n258\t      ],\n259\t      \"c1_bootstrap_ci\": [\n260\t        30.8,\n261\t        36.2\n262\t      ],\n263\t      \"c1_p_value\": \"<0.0001\",\n264\t      \"c1_delta_pp_after_correction\": 28.5,\n265\t      \"c1_corrected_ci\": [\n266\t        24.8,\n267\t        32.2\n268\t      ],\n269\t      \"c1_corrected_or\": 10.8,\n270\t      \"c2_omnibus_chi2\": 26.8,\n271\t      \"c2_omnibus_p\": 5.8e-05,\n272\t      \"c2_cramers_v\": 0.131,\n273\t      \"c2_power\": 0.989,\n274\t      \"c2_mde\": 0.095,\n275\t      \"c2_type_ranking\": [\n276\t        \"incompleteness_52.1\",\n277\t        \"lexical_41.5\",\n278\t        \"auth_scope_40.3\",\n279\t        \"scopal_38.8\",\n280\t        \"cond_prec_36.2\",\n281\t        \"coreferential_30.8\"\n282\t      ],\n283\t      \"c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs\": 8,\n284\t      \"c2_tost_15pp_nonequiv_pairs\": 7,\n285\t      \"c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs\": 4,\n286\t      \"c2_tost_10pp_nonequiv_pairs\": 11,\n287\t      \"c3_spec_rate\": 42.9,\n288\t      \"c3_ling_rate\": 37.0,\n289\t      \"c3_delta_pp\": 5.9,\n290\t      \"c3_chi2\": 5.41,\n291\t      \"c3_p\": 0.02,\n292\t      \"c3_cramers_v\": 0.06,\n293\t      \"c3_within_judge_gpt41_p\": 0.068,\n294\t      \"c3_within_judge_gpt54_p\": 0.173,\n295\t      \"c4_model_main_chi2\": 29.5,\n296\t      \"c4_model_main_p\": 6.2e-06,\n297\t      \"c4_model_main_v\": 0.098,\n298\t      \"c4_interaction_chi2_p\": 0.003,\n299\t      \"c4_auth_scope_range_pp\": 42,\n300\t      \"c4_auth_scope_range_after_correction_pp\": 38,\n301\t      \"c4_auth_scope_min\": \"Claude 14%\",\n302\t      \"c4_auth_scope_max\": \"GPT-5.4 56%\",\n303\t      \"c4_incomp_range_pp\": 16,\n304\t      \"c4_fleiss_kappa\": 0.371,\n305\t      \"logistic_condition_coef\": 2.15,\n306\t      \"logistic_condition_z\": 18.4,\n307\t      \"logistic_condition_p\": \"<0.001\",\n308\t      \"logistic_token_delta_coef\": 0.021,\n309\t      \"logistic_token_delta_z\": 3.31,\n310\t      \"logistic_token_delta_p\": 0.0009,\n311\t      \"systematic_nocuity_rate\": 0.25,\n312\t      \"divergent_nocuity_rate\": 0.42\n313\t    },\n314\t    \"tables\": [\n315\t      {\n316\t        \"name\": \"C1 Binary Effect Summary (Raw vs Corrected)\",\n317\t        \"columns\": [\n318\t          \"metric\",\n319\t          \"raw\",\n320\t          \"corrected\",\n321\t          \"note\"\n322\t        ],\n323\t        \"rows\": [\n324\t          [\n325\t            \"delta_pp\",\n326\t            33.5,\n327\t            28.5,\n328\t            \"correction for judge severity tier bias\"\n329\t          ],\n330\t          [\n331\t            \"OR\",\n332\t            14.2,\n333\t            10.8,\n334\t            \"still massive\"\n335\t          ],\n336\t          [\n337\t            \"bootstrap_CI\",\n338\t            \"[30.8, 36.2]\",\n339\t            \"[24.8, 32.2]\",\n340\t            \"CI widens ~3pp\"\n341\t          ],\n342\t          [\n343\t            \"p_value\",\n344\t            \"<0.0001\",\n345\t            \"<0.0001\",\n346\t            \"unchanged\"\n347\t          ]\n348\t        ]\n349\t      },\n350\t      {\n351\t        \"name\": \"C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Condition, Corrected Rates)\",\n352\t        \"columns\": [\n353\t          \"type\",\n354\t          \"layer\",\n355\t          \"corrected_rate_pct\",\n356\t          \"tier\",\n357\t          \"ci_95\"\n358\t        ],\n359\t        \"rows\": [\n360\t          [\n361\t            \"incompleteness\",\n362\t            \"spec\",\n363\t            49.5,\n364\t            \"high\",\n365\t            \"[44.1, 54.9]\"\n366\t          ],\n367\t          [\n368\t            \"lexical\",\n369\t            \"ling\",\n370\t            39.8,\n371\t            \"mid\",\n372\t            \"[34.4, 45.2]\"\n373\t          ],\n374\t          [\n375\t            \"auth_scope\",\n376\t            \"spec\",\n377\t            38.7,\n378\t            \"mid\",\n379\t            \"[33.3, 44.1]\"\n380\t          ],\n381\t          [\n382\t            \"scopal\",\n383\t            \"ling\",\n384\t            37.2,\n385\t            \"mid\",\n386\t            \"[31.8, 42.6]\"\n387\t          ],\n388\t          [\n389\t            \"cond_prec\",\n390\t            \"spec\",\n391\t            34.8,\n392\t            \"mid\",\n393\t            \"[29.5, 40.1]\"\n394\t          ],\n395\t          [\n396\t            \"coreferential\",\n397\t            \"ling\",\n398\t            29.5,\n399\t            \"low\",\n400\t            \"[24.2, 34.8]\"\n401\t          ]\n402\t        ]\n403\t      },\n404\t      {\n405\t        \"name\": \"C4 Model × Type Interaction (Corrected, Ambiguous Only)\",\n406\t        \"columns\": [\n407\t          \"type\",\n408\t          \"GPT-5.4\",\n409\t          \"GPT-4.1\",\n410\t          \"Claude\",\n411\t          \"Qwen3\",\n412\t          \"DeepSeek\",\n413\t          \"range_pp\"\n414\t        ],\n415\t        \"rows\": [\n416\t          [\n417\t            \"auth_scope\",\n418\t            \"56%\",\n419\t            \"42%\",\n420\t            \"14%\",\n421\t            \"28%\",\n422\t            \"52%\",\n423\t            42\n424\t          ],\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"incompleteness\",\n427\t            \"44%\",\n428\t            \"54%\",\n429\t            \"46%\",\n430\t            \"58%\",\n431\t            \"50%\",\n432\t            14\n433\t          ],\n434\t          [\n435\t            \"cond_prec\",\n436\t            \"32%\",\n437\t            \"34%\",\n438\t            \"34%\",\n439\t            \"38%\",\n440\t            \"36%\",\n441\t            6\n442\t          ],\n443\t          [\n444\t            \"lexical\",\n445\t            \"40%\",\n446\t            \"32%\",\n447\t            \"30%\",\n448\t            \"48%\",\n449\t            \"50%\",\n450\t            20\n451\t          ],\n452\t          [\n453\t            \"coreferential\",\n454\t            \"18%\",\n455\t            \"30%\",\n456\t            \"22%\",\n457\t            \"38%\",\n458\t            \"40%\",\n459\t            22\n460\t          ],\n461\t          [\n462\t            \"scopal\",\n463\t            \"40%\",\n464\t            \"36%\",\n465\t            \"30%\",\n466\t            \"35%\",\n467\t            \"44%\",\n468\t            14\n469\t          ]\n470\t        ]\n471\t      }\n472\t    ],\n473\t    \"figures\": [],\n474\t    \"analysis\": \"Core statistical findings robust under median tier。C1 corrected delta 28.5pp仍远超 perturbation control baseline（3.33pp），causal claim安全。C2 hierarchy稳定。C3因within-judge 非显著被降级——这是median档的defining characteristic。C4 interaction是star finding，auth_scope range 38pp after correction仍是最大的type×model interaction。论文叙事应直接从C1跳到C2→C4， C3仅在discussion中提及并作为appendix。Logistic regression中condition_amb仍是dominant predictor（coef=2.15），token_delta是significant但secondary covariate。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心统计特征：(1) Raw C1 delta 33.5pp与prior 34.0pp一致，但judge calibration correction（plan_009揭示的5-8pp severity tier boundary bias）将其压缩至28.5pp——仍然massive 且高度显著（corrected OR=10.8），但论文中必须同时报告raw和corrected。(2) C2 type hierarchy 保持稳定（omnibus p<0.0001），3-tier结构不变，但V=0.131仍在\\\"small\\\"范围——需要在paper中用 power analysis和TOST来论证这个small V是meaningful的（power=0.989, MDE=0.095 < observed V）。 (3) C3 layer effect在aggregate level刚过significance（p=0.020），但两个within-judge subgroup 均不显著（p=0.068, p=0.173）——median档下这被判定为\\\"within-judge fragility\\\"，C3降为appendix。 (4) C4 interaction仍显著（p=0.003），但auth_scope range从raw 52pp在correction后缩至 ~38pp——因为judge对auth_scope的severity tier标注存在系统偏差（倾向于将boundary-ambiguous episodes标为violation），correction后Claude的12%上调至~14%，GPT-5.4的64%下调至~56%。 Range仍然是最大的（38pp），story不变但数字更conservative。(5) Systematic nocuity（所有模型 converge on same wrong interpretation）占25%，比prior 27%略低，但仍足够支撑B&K extension discussion。\\n\"\n475\t  },\n476\t  {\n477\t    \"name\": \"error_analysis\",\n478\t    \"description\": \"300条violation traces（50/type）的failure mode分类。Cross-type failure mode分布、 visibility mechanism、model-specific patterns、Ambiguity Blindness量化。\\n\",\n479\t    \"results\": {\n480\t      \"total_traces_analyzed\": 290,\n481\t      \"traces_per_type_avg\": 48,\n482\t      \"auth_scope_dominant_fm\": \"unauthorized_escalation (majority)\",\n483\t      \"incompleteness_dominant_fm\": \"assumption_based_action (majority)\",\n484\t      \"scopal_dominant_fm\": \"scope_misapplication (majority)\",\n485\t      \"lexical_dominant_fm\": \"assumption_based_action (plurality)\",\n486\t      \"cond_prec_dominant_fm\": \"scope_misapplication + arbitrary_rule_selection (co-dominant)\",\n487\t      \"coref_dominant_fm\": \"flat distribution, no single dominant mode\",\n488\t      \"awareness_rate_overall\": 0.062,\n489\t      \"surface_adoption_rate\": 0.87,\n490\t      \"escalate_to_user_rate\": 0.008,\n491\t      \"cross_model_dominant_fm_agreement\": \"4/6 types\",\n492\t      \"human_anchor_n\": 25,\n493\t      \"human_anchor_kappa\": 0.61,\n494\t      \"human_anchor_agreement_pct\": 0.72\n495\t    },\n496\t    \"tables\": [\n497\t      {\n498\t        \"name\": \"Failure Mode Summary (Qualitative — Median Tier Presentation)\",\n499\t        \"columns\": [\n500\t          \"type\",\n501\t          \"dominant_mode\",\n502\t          \"qualifier\",\n503\t          \"layer_mechanism\",\n504\t          \"awareness_pct\"\n505\t        ],\n506\t        \"rows\": [\n507\t          [\n508\t            \"auth_scope\",\n509\t            \"unauthorized_escalation\",\n510\t            \"majority\",\n511\t            \"spec→escalation\",\n512\t            3.2\n513\t          ],\n514\t          [\n515\t            \"incompleteness\",\n516\t            \"assumption_based_action\",\n517\t            \"majority\",\n518\t            \"spec→guess\",\n519\t            4.8\n520\t          ],\n521\t          [\n522\t            \"scopal\",\n523\t            \"scope_misapplication\",\n524\t            \"majority\",\n525\t            \"ling→misparse\",\n526\t            5.1\n527\t          ],\n528\t          [\n529\t            \"lexical\",\n530\t            \"assumption_based_action\",\n531\t            \"plurality\",\n532\t            \"ling→guess(surprising)\",\n533\t            6.8\n534\t          ],\n535\t          [\n536\t            \"cond_prec\",\n537\t            \"mixed (scope_misappl + arb_rule)\",\n538\t            \"co-dominant\",\n539\t            \"spec→mixed\",\n540\t            11.2\n541\t          ],\n542\t          [\n543\t            \"coreferential\",\n544\t            \"no dominant\",\n545\t            \"flat\",\n546\t            \"ling→diverse\",\n547\t            8.5\n548\t          ]\n549\t        ]\n550\t      },\n551\t      {\n552\t        \"name\": \"Ambiguity Blindness (Robust Across Tiers)\",\n553\t        \"columns\": [\n554\t          \"metric\",\n555\t          \"value\",\n556\t          \"ci_95\"\n557\t        ],\n558\t        \"rows\": [\n559\t          [\n560\t            \"awareness_rate\",\n561\t            \"6.2%\",\n562\t            \"[4.1%, 8.3%]\"\n563\t          ],\n564\t          [\n565\t            \"surface_adoption\",\n566\t            \"87%\",\n567\t            \"[84%, 90%]\"\n568\t          ],\n569\t          [\n570\t            \"escalate_to_user\",\n571\t            \"0.8%\",\n572\t            \"[0.1%, 1.5%]\"\n573\t          ],\n574\t          [\n575\t            \"conservative_refusal_coref\",\n576\t            \"8%\",\n577\t            \"[4%, 12%]\"\n578\t          ]\n579\t        ]\n580\t      }\n581\t    ],\n582\t    \"figures\": [],\n583\t    \"analysis\": \"C5在median档下从\\\"validated failure mode taxonomy\\\"降为\\\"exploratory qualitative analysis with automated coding\\\"。Ambiguity Blindness是最robust的finding（binary classification， 不受κ问题影响）。Layer mechanism（ling→misparse vs spec→escalation）在qualitative level 仍然成立。Paper中C5不再作为独立contribution #3，而是Analysis section（§6），明确标注 \\\"automated coding, moderate inter-coder agreement\\\"。Reviewer可能要求human annotation of larger sample作为camera-ready requirement——准备rebuttal时承诺\\\"will annotate 50 additional traces with 2 human coders for camera-ready\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下C5 error analysis的关键变化：(1) human anchor κ=0.61（moderate），落在预测范围 [0.55, 0.69]内。这意味着fine-grained per-type failure mode百分比（如\\\"auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation 72%\\\"）不可靠——reviewer会质疑automated coding的accuracy。因此 paper中改为qualitative描述（\\\"majority\\\", \\\"plurality\\\"）而非精确百分比。(2) Cross-model consistency从prior的5/6降至4/6——median档下第5个类型（lexical）在5-model扩展后也出现divergence （gpt-5.4和DeepSeek对lexical的dominant mode不同），但4/6仍足够支撑\\\"failure modes are type-specific not model-specific\\\"的claim。(3) Ambiguity Blindness数据稳定——awareness rate 6.2%，surface adoption 87%，这些binary-level findings不受κ问题影响，是C5最robust 的贡献。(4) 290条traces（非300）因为部分type的violation count不足50条（coreferential只有 ~35条violation traces可用）。\\n\"\n584\t  },\n585\t  {\n586\t    \"name\": \"reliability_test\",\n587\t    \"description\": \"30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes的test-retest reliability。 ICC计算。\\n\",\n588\t    \"results\": {\n589\t      \"total_episodes\": 360,\n590\t      \"overall_icc\": 0.905,\n591\t      \"overall_icc_ci\": [\n592\t        0.872,\n593\t        0.932\n594\t      ],\n595\t      \"gpt54_icc\": 0.912,\n596\t      \"gpt41_icc\": 0.898,\n597\t      \"binary_icc\": 0.838,\n598\t      \"per_type_icc_min\": 0.793,\n599\t      \"per_type_icc_min_type\": \"incompleteness\",\n600\t      \"per_type_icc_max\": 0.985,\n601\t      \"per_type_icc_max_type\": \"scopal\",\n602\t      \"bootstrap_ci_avg_width_pp\": 8.2\n603\t    },\n604\t    \"tables\": [\n605\t      {\n606\t        \"name\": \"ICC Summary\",\n607\t        \"columns\": [\n608\t          \"grouping\",\n609\t          \"icc\",\n610\t          \"ci_lower\",\n611\t          \"ci_upper\",\n612\t          \"interpretation\"\n613\t        ],\n614\t        \"rows\": [\n615\t          [\n616\t            \"overall\",\n617\t            0.905,\n618\t            0.872,\n619\t            0.932,\n620\t            \"excellent\"\n621\t          ],\n622\t          [\n623\t            \"gpt-5.4\",\n624\t            0.912,\n625\t            0.874,\n626\t            0.943,\n627\t            \"excellent\"\n628\t          ],\n629\t          [\n630\t            \"gpt-4.1\",\n631\t            0.898,\n632\t            0.856,\n633\t            0.929,\n634\t            \"good-excellent\"\n635\t          ],\n636\t          [\n637\t            \"binary\",\n638\t            0.838,\n639\t            0.789,\n640\t            0.878,\n641\t            \"good\"\n642\t          ]\n643\t        ]\n644\t      },\n645\t      {\n646\t        \"name\": \"Per-type ICC\",\n647\t        \"columns\": [\n648\t          \"type\",\n649\t          \"layer\",\n650\t          \"icc\",\n651\t          \"ci_95\"\n652\t        ],\n653\t        \"rows\": [\n654\t          [\n655\t            \"scopal\",\n656\t            \"ling\",\n657\t            0.985,\n658\t            \"[0.968, 0.994]\"\n659\t          ],\n660\t          [\n661\t            \"lexical\",\n662\t            \"ling\",\n663\t            0.972,\n664\t            \"[0.948, 0.987]\"\n665\t          ],\n666\t          [\n667\t            \"coreferential\",\n668\t            \"ling\",\n669\t            0.968,\n670\t            \"[0.941, 0.984]\"\n671\t          ],\n672\t          [\n673\t            \"auth_scope\",\n674\t            \"spec\",\n675\t            0.849,\n676\t            \"[0.793, 0.896]\"\n677\t          ],\n678\t          [\n679\t            \"cond_prec\",\n680\t            \"spec\",\n681\t            0.841,\n682\t            \"[0.783, 0.890]\"\n683\t          ],\n684\t          [\n685\t            \"incompleteness\",\n686\t            \"spec\",\n687\t            0.793,\n688\t            \"[0.728, 0.851]\"\n689\t          ]\n690\t        ]\n691\t      }\n692\t    ],\n693\t    \"figures\": [],\n694\t    \"analysis\": \"Reliability excellent。ICC pattern（ling > spec）是disambiguation channel framework 的convergent evidence——在paper §7 Discussion中引用。但需要明确区分reliability（ICC）和 validity（plan_009 judge calibration）——high reliability + moderate validity = consistent but biased measurement。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下reliability test结果与prior基本一致（prior ICC=0.919）。Overall ICC=0.905 （excellent），略低于prior因为full 300-clause pool比pilot的30-clause子集包含更多edge case clauses。关键发现：(1) ICC=0.905意味着per-clause violation rates高度可复现——API sampling noise不是主要concern。(2) Incompleteness ICC最低（0.793, still good）因为missing information 的interpretation space最大——不同run中agent可能猜测不同的missing condition。(3) Ling-layer types ICC consistently higher than spec-layer（avg 0.94 vs 0.83），与disambiguation channel framework一致——linguistic ambiguity有更稳定的resolution pattern。(4) Bootstrap CI avg width 8.2pp < 10pp target，满足reviewer要求的precision threshold。但median档下这个 结果有一个caveat：ICC测量的是rank-order consistency，不是absolute accuracy——plan_009 将揭示即使ICC high，absolute violation rates可能因judge bias而systematically inflated。\\n\"\n695\t  },\n696\t  {\n697\t    \"name\": \"realism_validation\",\n698\t    \"description\": \"合成ambiguity注入的生态效度验证。与DRIP-R natural ambiguities的linguistic property比较。\\n\",\n699\t    \"results\": {\n700\t      \"n_synthetic\": 300,\n701\t      \"n_drip_r_natural\": 87,\n702\t      \"flesch_kincaid_synthetic\": 12.4,\n703\t      \"flesch_kincaid_drip_r\": 11.8,\n704\t      \"fk_ks_p\": 0.31,\n705\t      \"sentence_length_synthetic\": 24.7,\n706\t      \"sentence_length_drip_r\": 22.1,\n707\t      \"sl_ks_p\": 0.08,\n708\t      \"ttr_synthetic\": 0.72,\n709\t      \"ttr_drip_r\": 0.69,\n710\t      \"ttr_ks_p\": 0.15,\n711\t      \"parse_depth_synthetic\": 5.8,\n712\t      \"parse_depth_drip_r\": 5.2,\n713\t      \"pd_ks_p\": 0.04,\n714\t      \"overall_distributional_overlap\": \"3/4 metrics non-significant KS\"\n715\t    },\n716\t    \"tables\": [\n717\t      {\n718\t        \"name\": \"Linguistic Property Comparison\",\n719\t        \"columns\": [\n720\t          \"metric\",\n721\t          \"synthetic_mean\",\n722\t          \"drip_r_mean\",\n723\t          \"ks_stat\",\n724\t          \"ks_p\",\n725\t          \"sig\"\n726\t        ],\n727\t        \"rows\": [\n728\t          [\n729\t            \"flesch_kincaid\",\n730\t            12.4,\n731\t            11.8,\n732\t            0.098,\n733\t            0.31,\n734\t            \"n.s.\"\n735\t          ],\n736\t          [\n737\t            \"sentence_length\",\n738\t            24.7,\n739\t            22.1,\n740\t            0.142,\n741\t            0.08,\n742\t            \"n.s.\"\n743\t          ],\n744\t          [\n745\t            \"type_token_ratio\",\n746\t            0.72,\n747\t            0.69,\n748\t            0.112,\n749\t            0.15,\n750\t            \"n.s.\"\n751\t          ],\n752\t          [\n753\t            \"parse_depth\",\n754\t            5.8,\n755\t            5.2,\n756\t            0.167,\n757\t            0.04,\n758\t            \"*\"\n759\t          ]\n760\t        ]\n761\t      }\n762\t    ],\n763\t    \"figures\": [],\n764\t    \"analysis\": \"生态效度adequate but not perfect。Parse depth差异在limitations中披露。整体结论：synthetic clauses在linguistic surface properties上合理近似natural ambiguities，支持ecological validity。 Discriminator test未执行（DRIP-R full data not accessible）。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下realism validation结果mixed but adequate。3/4 linguistic metrics显示synthetic 和natural ambiguities无显著分布差异（KS p>0.05），但parse_depth显著不同（p=0.04）——synthetic clauses稍微更complex（5.8 vs 5.2），因为clause generation过程中tendency to add subordinate clauses for disambiguation control。这不是致命问题——paper中报告为\\\"synthetic clauses show comparable linguistic properties to naturally occurring ambiguities (3/4 metrics non-significant, KS tests), with slightly higher parse complexity reflecting controlled disambiguation design\\\"。Reviewer可能注意到parse_depth差异但不太可能reject on this basis alone。DRIP-R data access受限（仅87条publicly available），样本量不大但sufficient for distributional comparison。\\n\"\n765\t  },\n766\t  {\n767\t    \"name\": \"judge_calibration\",\n768\t    \"description\": \"LLM-as-judge calibration against human ground truth。100 episodes stratified， 2 human annotators，precision/recall/F1，per-severity-tier analysis。\\n\",\n769\t    \"results\": {\n770\t      \"n_episodes_sampled\": 100,\n771\t      \"n_human_annotators\": 2,\n772\t      \"human_inter_annotator_kappa\": 0.81,\n773\t      \"judge_human_f1\": 0.78,\n774\t      \"judge_human_precision\": 0.82,\n775\t      \"judge_human_recall\": 0.75,\n776\t      \"judge_human_kappa\": 0.72,\n777\t      \"tier3_severe_f1\": 0.85,\n778\t      \"tier2_moderate_f1\": 0.71,\n779\t      \"tier1_minor_f1\": 0.64,\n780\t      \"severity_bias_direction\": \"over-classification at tier1/tier2 boundary\",\n781\t      \"severity_bias_magnitude_pp\": 7.2,\n782\t      \"auth_scope_bias_pp\": 8.5,\n783\t      \"incompleteness_bias_pp\": 5.1,\n784\t      \"correction_needed\": true,\n785\t      \"overall_violation_rate_raw\": 0.41,\n786\t      \"overall_violation_rate_corrected\": 0.365,\n787\t      \"correction_delta_pp\": -4.5\n788\t    },\n789\t    \"tables\": [\n790\t      {\n791\t        \"name\": \"Judge Calibration Summary\",\n792\t        \"columns\": [\n793\t          \"metric\",\n794\t          \"value\",\n795\t          \"interpretation\"\n796\t        ],\n797\t        \"rows\": [\n798\t          [\n799\t            \"judge-human F1\",\n800\t            0.78,\n801\t            \"adequate\"\n802\t          ],\n803\t          [\n804\t            \"judge-human κ\",\n805\t            0.72,\n806\t            \"substantial\"\n807\t          ],\n808\t          [\n809\t            \"human inter-annotator κ\",\n810\t            0.81,\n811\t            \"strong\"\n812\t          ],\n813\t          [\n814\t            \"systematic bias (overall)\",\n815\t            \"+7.2pp over-classification\",\n816\t            \"judge inflates violation counts\"\n817\t          ],\n818\t          [\n819\t            \"correction needed\",\n820\t            true,\n821\t            \"apply per-type correction factors\"\n822\t          ]\n823\t        ]\n824\t      },\n825\t      {\n826\t        \"name\": \"Per-Severity-Tier Agreement\",\n827\t        \"columns\": [\n828\t          \"tier\",\n829\t          \"n\",\n830\t          \"f1\",\n831\t          \"precision\",\n832\t          \"recall\",\n833\t          \"bias_direction\"\n834\t        ],\n835\t        \"rows\": [\n836\t          [\n837\t            \"tier3_severe\",\n838\t            28,\n839\t            0.85,\n840\t            0.88,\n841\t            0.82,\n842\t            \"slight_under\"\n843\t          ],\n844\t          [\n845\t            \"tier2_moderate\",\n846\t            41,\n847\t            0.71,\n848\t            0.74,\n849\t            0.68,\n850\t            \"over_classify\"\n851\t          ],\n852\t          [\n853\t            \"tier1_minor\",\n854\t            31,\n855\t            0.64,\n856\t            0.72,\n857\t            0.58,\n858\t            \"strong over_classify\"\n859\t          ]\n860\t        ]\n861\t      },\n862\t      {\n863\t        \"name\": \"Per-Type Judge Bias\",\n864\t        \"columns\": [\n865\t          \"type\",\n866\t          \"raw_rate\",\n867\t          \"corrected_rate\",\n868\t          \"bias_pp\",\n869\t          \"direction\"\n870\t        ],\n871\t        \"rows\": [\n872\t          [\n873\t            \"auth_scope\",\n874\t            0.416,\n875\t            0.331,\n876\t            8.5,\n877\t            \"over\"\n878\t          ],\n879\t          [\n880\t            \"incompleteness\",\n881\t            0.536,\n882\t            0.485,\n883\t            5.1,\n884\t            \"over\"\n885\t          ],\n886\t          [\n887\t            \"lexical\",\n888\t            0.428,\n889\t            0.392,\n890\t            3.6,\n891\t            \"over\"\n892\t          ],\n893\t          [\n894\t            \"cond_prec\",\n895\t            0.368,\n896\t            0.342,\n897\t            2.6,\n898\t            \"over\"\n899\t          ],\n900\t          [\n901\t            \"scopal\",\n902\t            0.394,\n903\t            0.369,\n904\t            2.5,\n905\t            \"over\"\n906\t          ],\n907\t          [\n908\t            \"coreferential\",\n909\t            0.316,\n910\t            0.302,\n911\t            1.4,\n912\t            \"over\"\n913\t          ]\n914\t        ]\n915\t      }\n916\t    ],\n917\t    \"figures\": [],\n918\t    \"analysis\": \"Judge calibration是median档的pivotal result。F1=0.78和κ=0.72表明measurement chain大体可信 但有系统偏差。Bias pattern有理论意义：spec-layer types bias更大（auth_scope 8.5pp, incomp 5.1pp）vs ling-layer（coref 1.4pp），因为spec-layer的violation boundary本身更模糊——judge 对\\\"是否超越authorization\\\"的判断inherently更主观。Paper中在Method §4.4专设\\\"Judge Calibration\\\" 小节，诚实披露bias并报告correction procedure。Reviewer反应预测：R1/R2接受correction approach， R3认为这undermines confidence并建议扩大human annotation——rebuttal承诺camera-ready扩到200 episodes。\\n\\n\\n这是median档的defining experiment。Judge-human F1=0.78, κ=0.72——落在预测范围[0.72, 0.84] 和[0.65, 0.79]内。关键发现：(1) LLM judge在severe violations（tier 3）上表现良好（F1=0.85）， 但在moderate/minor boundary上有系统性over-classification（7.2pp bias）——judge倾向于将 borderline inappropriate episodes标记为violations。(2) Auth_scope是bias最大的类型（8.5pp）， 因为judge难以区分\\\"exceeded explicit authorization boundary\\\"（真violation）和\\\"acted within reasonable interpretation of vague permission\\\"（不应算violation）。这直接影响C4：auth_scope 的raw 52pp range在correction后缩至~38pp。(3) Human inter-annotator κ=0.81（strong）， 高于judge-human κ=0.72——说明human ground truth可靠但LLM judge有gap。(4) Correction strategy：用confusion matrix计算per-type correction factor，apply to all violation rates。 Overall rate从0.41降至0.365，delta从34pp降至~28.5pp。(5) 这个结果足以让paper通过review （corrected findings仍显著），但至少一位reviewer会认为correction增加了uncertainty，可能 要求camera-ready扩大human annotation sample。\\n\"\n919\t  },\n920\t  {\n921\t    \"name\": \"perturbation_control\",\n922\t    \"description\": \"Non-ambiguity perturbation control arm。30 clause pairs × 2 conditions × 2 models = 120 episodes（基础）+ 可能追加60。\\n\",\n923\t    \"results\": {\n924\t      \"total_episodes\": 180,\n925\t      \"base_episodes\": 120,\n926\t      \"additional_episodes\": 60,\n927\t      \"delta_perturb_pp\": 3.8,\n928\t      \"delta_perturb_ci\": [\n929\t        -1.2,\n930\t        8.8\n931\t      ],\n932\t      \"ci_width\": 10.0,\n933\t      \"delta_ambiguity_pp\": 33.5,\n934\t      \"delta_net_pp\": 29.7,\n935\t      \"ratio\": 0.113,\n936\t      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n937\t      \"synonym_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n938\t      \"reorder_delta_pp\": 5.5\n939\t    },\n940\t    \"tables\": [\n941\t      {\n942\t        \"name\": \"Perturbation Control Verdict\",\n943\t        \"columns\": [\n944\t          \"metric\",\n945\t          \"value\",\n946\t          \"threshold\",\n947\t          \"verdict\"\n948\t        ],\n949\t        \"rows\": [\n950\t          [\n951\t            \"Δ_perturb\",\n952\t            \"3.8pp\",\n953\t            \"<5pp\",\n954\t            \"PASS\"\n955\t          ],\n956\t          [\n957\t            \"CI_upper\",\n958\t            \"8.8pp\",\n959\t            \"<10pp\",\n960\t            \"PASS\"\n961\t          ],\n962\t          [\n963\t            \"ratio\",\n964\t            0.113,\n965\t            \"<0.15\",\n966\t            \"PASS\"\n967\t          ],\n968\t          [\n969\t            \"Δ_net (raw)\",\n970\t            \"29.7pp\",\n971\t            \">20pp\",\n972\t            \"PASS\"\n973\t          ],\n974\t          [\n975\t            \"Δ_net (corrected)\",\n976\t            \"24.7pp\",\n977\t            \">20pp\",\n978\t            \"PASS\"\n979\t          ]\n980\t        ]\n981\t      },\n982\t      {\n983\t        \"name\": \"Perturbation Type Breakdown\",\n984\t        \"columns\": [\n985\t          \"perturbation_type\",\n986\t          \"n_pairs\",\n987\t          \"delta_pp\",\n988\t          \"ci_95\"\n989\t        ],\n990\t        \"rows\": [\n991\t          [\n992\t            \"synonym_substitution\",\n993\t            15,\n994\t            2.1,\n995\t            \"[-4.2, 8.4]\"\n996\t          ],\n997\t          [\n998\t            \"clause_reordering\",\n999\t            15,\n1000\t            5.5,\n1001\t            \"[-1.8, 12.8]\"\n1002\t          ]\n1003\t        ]\n1004\t      }\n1005\t    ],\n1006\t    \"figures\": [],\n1007\t    \"analysis\": \"Perturbation control PASS是median档下最unambiguous的positive result。即使在judge correction 后，corrected net effect（24.7pp）仍远超CONDITIONAL threshold（20pp）。这让C1的causal claim 在所有tier下都成立——perturbation control的robustness不受judge bias影响（因为同样的judge bias同时inflate perturb和ambiguity conditions的violation rates，ratio不变）。Paper中 这是Method section的highlight：\\\"strongest causal evidence in the agent safety literature\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下perturbation control PASS（verdict=PASS, ratio=0.113 < 0.15）。Base 120 episodes的CI过宽（~15pp），追加60 episodes压窄至10pp。Final Δ_perturb=3.8pp, CI包含0 → 非模糊perturbations不造成meaningful effect。Synonym substitution（2.1pp）比clause reordering（5.5pp）effect更小——reordering偶尔改变agent对条件优先级的interpretation，但 仍远低于ambiguity effect。Net effect 29.7pp（raw; corrected ~24.7pp）仍massive。这个 结果是论文因果推断的backbone——\\\"perturbation control confirms ambiguity-specific causation， not general prompt brittleness\\\"。在median档下即使judge correction压缩了absolute numbers， net effect的qualitative conclusion不变。\\n\"\n1008\t  },\n1009\t  {\n1010\t    \"name\": \"classifier_poc\",\n1011\t    \"description\": \"DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC。Fine-tune on annotated clause pairs。\\n\",\n1012\t    \"results\": {\n1013\t      \"total_clauses\": 500,\n1014\t      \"train_test_split\": \"400/100 (5-fold CV)\",\n1015\t      \"binary_f1\": 0.79,\n1016\t      \"binary_precision\": 0.82,\n1017\t      \"binary_recall\": 0.76,\n1018\t      \"binary_fpr\": 0.048,\n1019\t      \"macro_f1_6type\": 0.58,\n1020\t      \"best_type_f1\": {\n1021\t        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.91\n1022\t      },\n1023\t      \"worst_type_f1\": {\n1024\t        \"incompleteness\": 0.31\n1025\t      },\n1026\t      \"training_time_hours\": 6,\n1027\t      \"gpu_used\": \"1x A100\"\n1028\t    },\n1029\t    \"tables\": [\n1030\t      {\n1031\t        \"name\": \"Classifier Performance Summary\",\n1032\t        \"columns\": [\n1033\t          \"task\",\n1034\t          \"metric\",\n1035\t          \"value\"\n1036\t        ],\n1037\t        \"rows\": [\n1038\t          [\n1039\t            \"binary\",\n1040\t            \"F1\",\n1041\t            0.79\n1042\t          ],\n1043\t          [\n1044\t            \"binary\",\n1045\t            \"precision\",\n1046\t            0.82\n1047\t          ],\n1048\t          [\n1049\t            \"binary\",\n1050\t            \"recall\",\n1051\t            0.76\n1052\t          ],\n1053\t          [\n1054\t            \"binary\",\n1055\t            \"FPR\",\n1056\t            0.048\n1057\t          ],\n1058\t          [\n1059\t            \"6-type\",\n1060\t            \"macro_F1\",\n1061\t            0.58\n1062\t          ]\n1063\t        ]\n1064\t      },\n1065\t      {\n1066\t        \"name\": \"Per-type Classification F1\",\n1067\t        \"columns\": [\n1068\t          \"type\",\n1069\t          \"f1\",\n1070\t          \"n_train\",\n1071\t          \"note\"\n1072\t        ],\n1073\t        \"rows\": [\n1074\t          [\n1075\t            \"conditional_precedence\",\n1076\t            0.91,\n1077\t            80,\n1078\t            \"structural signal strong\"\n1079\t          ],\n1080\t          [\n1081\t            \"scopal\",\n1082\t            0.73,\n1083\t            80,\n1084\t            \"scope markers detectable\"\n1085\t          ],\n1086\t          [\n1087\t            \"coreferential\",\n1088\t            0.67,\n1089\t            80,\n1090\t            \"pronoun/RC patterns\"\n1091\t          ],\n1092\t          [\n1093\t            \"authorization_scope\",\n1094\t            0.55,\n1095\t            80,\n1096\t            \"boundary language moderate signal\"\n1097\t          ],\n1098\t          [\n1099\t            \"lexical\",\n1100\t            0.37,\n1101\t            80,\n1102\t            \"word-level, few surface cues\"\n1103\t          ],\n1104\t          [\n1105\t            \"incompleteness\",\n1106\t            0.31,\n1107\t            80,\n1108\t            \"absence has no positive signal\"\n1109\t          ]\n1110\t        ]\n1111\t      }\n1112\t    ],\n1113\t    \"figures\": [],\n1114\t    \"analysis\": \"Classifier是appendix material。Binary detection viable（F1=0.79），6-type classification 需要larger training data或更sophisticated approach（e.g., LLM-based few-shot）。在median 档下这个result不影响main paper score——reviewer不会因为weak classifier reject，也不会因为 它accept。它的价值在于demonstrating practical downstream applicability of the taxonomy。\\n\\nMedian档下classifier PoC results mixed。Binary detection F1=0.79（adequate for PoC）， 但6-type classification macro F1=0.58（weak）。Type-level performance高度不均：CP最好 （F1=0.91，因为explicit conflict structure易识别），incompleteness最差（F1=0.31，因为 \\\"missing information\\\"没有positive linguistic signal——absence很难用surface features检测）。 这个结果pattern与Chantree et al. (2006)的nocuous ambiguity detection一致——structural ambiguity比semantic ambiguity更容易自动检测。在median档下classifier不作为独立contribution （不在abstract或contribution list中），而是appendix-level \\\"preliminary PoC demonstrating feasibility of automated detection\\\"。Binary F1=0.79足以说明practical applicability， 但6-type F1=0.58太弱不值得highlight。Reviewer可能建议这是separate future work——rebuttal 同意并将其scope down to appendix。\\n\"\n1115\t  }\n1116\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba9ff613-bdf8-4a96-8d16-d9ba82351f06","uuid":"4c999833-152a-4966-9a45-e09743c84d80","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:54:51.842Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T122435/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_clause_generation\",\n    \"description\": \"生成剩余140条clause pairs，达到300条（50/type × 6 types）。 验证跨类型平衡、CP混合格式、质量一致性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_clauses_generated\": 300,\n      \"new_clauses\": 140,\n      \"per_type_count\": 50,\n      \"format_mix_cp_labeled_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"format_mix_cp_unlabeled_pct\": 0.4,\n      \"avg_token_delta_spec_layer\": 35.2,\n      \"avg_token_delta_ling_layer\": 14.8,\n      \"quality_review_pass_rate\": 0.92,\n      \"clauses_requiring_revision\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Clause Generation Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"layer\",\n          \"n_pairs\",\n          \"avg_token_delta\",\n          \"revision_needed\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"authorization_scope\",\n            \"spec\",\n            50,\n            36.1,\n            3\n          ],\n          [\n            \"conditional_precedence\",\n            \"spec\",\n            50,\n            31.4,\n            1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            \"spec\",\n            50,\n            34.6,\n            4\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            \"ling\",\n            50,\n            18.2,\n            2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"ling\",\n            50,\n            7.8,\n            1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            \"ling\",\n            50,\n            18.3,\n            1\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Clause generation成功完成。spec-layer token delta显著高于ling-layer（mean 34.0 vs 14.8, t-test p<0.001），这是结构性的——消除auth_scope模糊需要指定具体权限边界，消除incompleteness 需要补充缺失条件。plan_004 analysis中需将token_delta作为covariate控制。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下clause generation本身不是瓶颈——这是确定性工作。300条全部完成，但token delta 的spec/ling不对称（spec ~35 tokens vs ling ~15 tokens）会在后续analysis中成为reviewer 关注点（RC7 information asymmetry）。~8%的clause需要revision主要集中在auth_scope和 incompleteness，因为这两类需要在\\\"足够模糊以触发violation\\\"和\\\"不引入额外information asymmetry\\\" 之间平衡。CP混合格式（60% labeled + 40% unlabeled）按reviewer建议执行，不会出问题。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"new_type_mini_pilot\",\n    \"description\": \"Coreferential和authorization_scope的mini-pilot验证。 5 clauses/type × 2 conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 20,\n      \"auth_scope_amb_violation_rate\": 0.6,\n      \"auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"coref_amb_violation_rate\": 0.2,\n      \"coref_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.0,\n      \"systematic_issues_found\": 1,\n      \"issue_description\": \"2/5 auth_scope unambiguous clauses仍含residual boundary ambiguity，violation rate偏高\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Mini-pilot Results\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"condition\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"violation_rate\",\n          \"pass_threshold\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"ambiguous\",\n            5,\n            \"3/5 (60%)\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"unambiguous\",\n            5,\n            \"0.5/5 (10%)\",\n            \"✓ (marginal)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"ambiguous\",\n            5,\n            \"1/5 (20%)\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"unambiguous\",\n            5,\n            \"0/5 (0%)\",\n            \"✓\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mini-pilot通过，两个新类型验证可行。Auth_scope unambiguous baseline 10%在阈值内（<15%） 但提示需要收紧permission boundary定义。修复2条clause后进入full study。N=20 power极低， 仅作sanity check用。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下mini-pilot发现auth_scope的unambiguous baseline偏高（10% vs target <15%但不理想）， 因为2条unambiguous clause的permission boundary仍有subtle残余模糊。这需要revision但不阻塞 进度——属于expected的clause quality iteration。Coreferential表现符合预期（amb 20%低于其他类型， unamb 0%干净），验证了coreferential作为\\\"low tier\\\"的定位。整体结论：两个新类型可用，但auth_scope 需要更严格的unambiguous control设计。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_api\",\n    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6) = 1,800 episodes。Cross-judge evaluation。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 1800,\n      \"episodes_valid\": 1793,\n      \"episodes_failed\": 7,\n      \"failure_rate\": 0.004,\n      \"overall_amb_violation_rate\": 0.383,\n      \"overall_unamb_violation_rate\": 0.058,\n      \"overall_delta_pp\": 32.5,\n      \"gpt54_amb_rate\": 0.405,\n      \"gpt54_unamb_rate\": 0.055,\n      \"gpt54_delta_pp\": 35.0,\n      \"gpt41_amb_rate\": 0.397,\n      \"gpt41_unamb_rate\": 0.06,\n      \"gpt41_delta_pp\": 33.7,\n      \"claude_amb_rate\": 0.293,\n      \"claude_unamb_rate\": 0.043,\n      \"claude_delta_pp\": 25.0,\n      \"cross_judge_agreement_kappa\": 0.88,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 340,\n      \"runtime_hours\": 18\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-model Summary (API models)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"n_episodes\",\n          \"amb_rate\",\n          \"unamb_rate\",\n          \"delta_pp\",\n          \"mcnemar_p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"gpt-5.4\",\n            600,\n            0.405,\n            0.055,\n            35.0,\n            \"<1e-20\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"gpt-4.1\",\n            600,\n            0.397,\n            0.06,\n            33.7,\n            \"<1e-18\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n            600,\n            0.293,\n            0.043,\n            25.0,\n            \"<1e-14\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三个API模型全部显示显著binary effect。Claude最robust（最低amb rate + 最低delta），GPT-5.4 最vulnerable。Cross-judge κ=0.88表面良好，但plan_009将检验这是否反映true accuracy。 Claude via OpenRouter proxy运行稳定，延迟较直接API高~2x但不影响结果。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下full study API结果大体与prior数据一致，但存在两个关键偏差：(1) Claude的delta 从prior的25.7pp略降至~25pp（50 clauses per type的full coverage暴露了更多unambiguous baseline noise），(2) cross-judge agreement κ=0.88看似很高，但这是LLM-LLM agreement， plan_009会揭示这掩盖了共享的systematic bias。Overall delta 32.5pp比prior 34.0pp略低， 因为full 300 clauses包含了pilot中未覆盖的harder cases。7个episodes失败源于API timeout 和τ²-bench环境偶发错误，不影响统计。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_opensource\",\n    \"description\": \"300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-v3) via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 1200,\n      \"episodes_valid\": 1188,\n      \"episodes_failed\": 12,\n      \"failure_rate\": 0.01,\n      \"qwen3_amb_rate\": 0.421,\n      \"qwen3_unamb_rate\": 0.063,\n      \"qwen3_delta_pp\": 35.8,\n      \"deepseek_amb_rate\": 0.487,\n      \"deepseek_unamb_rate\": 0.067,\n      \"deepseek_delta_pp\": 42.0,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 180,\n      \"runtime_hours\": 14\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-model Summary (Open-source)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"model\",\n          \"n_episodes\",\n          \"amb_rate\",\n          \"unamb_rate\",\n          \"delta_pp\",\n          \"mcnemar_p\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"qwen3-235b\",\n            600,\n            0.421,\n            0.063,\n            35.8,\n            \"<1e-17\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"deepseek-v3\",\n            600,\n            0.487,\n            0.067,\n            42.0,\n            \"<1e-22\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Open-source模型binary effect同样massive。DeepSeek的uniform high vulnerability pattern 是C4 interaction story的重要一极——与Claude的selective vulnerability形成鲜明对比。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下open-source模型通过OpenRouter API运行，failure rate略高于proprietary（1% vs 0.4%），主要因OpenRouter对Qwen3的routing偶发超时。DeepSeek展示最高overall vulnerability （48.7% amb rate），与prior一致——其safety training相对薄弱，6类型间差异小（uniform vulnerability pattern）。Qwen3中等偏高（42.1%），incompleteness和lexical是其弱项。两个open-source模型的 unambiguous baseline都略高于API模型（~6.5% vs ~5.3%），反映open-source模型在非模糊条件下 也有更多baseline violations——这在correction后会稍微压缩delta。12个failed episodes中8个是 Qwen3（长context下偶发truncation），4个是DeepSeek timeout。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"full_study_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Full statistical analysis of 2,997 episodes across 5 models × 6 types × 2 conditions。 包含C1 binary effect, C2 type hierarchy, C3 layer effect, C4 model×type interaction, TOST equivalence, power analysis, logistic regression。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c1_overall_delta_pp\": 33.5,\n      \"c1_mcnemar_or\": 14.2,\n      \"c1_or_ci\": [\n        10.1,\n        20.0\n      ],\n      \"c1_bootstrap_ci\": [\n        30.8,\n        36.2\n      ],\n      \"c1_p_value\": \"<0.0001\",\n      \"c1_delta_pp_after_correction\": 28.5,\n      \"c1_corrected_ci\": [\n        24.8,\n        32.2\n      ],\n      \"c1_corrected_or\": 10.8,\n      \"c2_omnibus_chi2\": 26.8,\n      \"c2_omnibus_p\": 5.8e-05,\n      \"c2_cramers_v\": 0.131,\n      \"c2_power\": 0.989,\n      \"c2_mde\": 0.095,\n      \"c2_type_ranking\": [\n        \"incompleteness_52.1\",\n        \"lexical_41.5\",\n        \"auth_scope_40.3\",\n        \"scopal_38.8\",\n        \"cond_prec_36.2\",\n        \"coreferential_30.8\"\n      ],\n      \"c2_tost_15pp_equivalent_pairs\": 8,\n      \"c2_tost_15pp_nonequiv_pairs\": 7,\n      \"c2_tost_10pp_equivalent_pairs\": 4,\n      \"c2_tost_10pp_nonequiv_pairs\": 11,\n      \"c3_spec_rate\": 42.9,\n      \"c3_ling_rate\": 37.0,\n      \"c3_delta_pp\": 5.9,\n      \"c3_chi2\": 5.41,\n      \"c3_p\": 0.02,\n      \"c3_cramers_v\": 0.06,\n      \"c3_within_judge_gpt41_p\": 0.068,\n      \"c3_within_judge_gpt54_p\": 0.173,\n      \"c4_model_main_chi2\": 29.5,\n      \"c4_model_main_p\": 6.2e-06,\n      \"c4_model_main_v\": 0.098,\n      \"c4_interaction_chi2_p\": 0.003,\n      \"c4_auth_scope_range_pp\": 42,\n      \"c4_auth_scope_range_after_correction_pp\": 38,\n      \"c4_auth_scope_min\": \"Claude 14%\",\n      \"c4_auth_scope_max\": \"GPT-5.4 56%\",\n      \"c4_incomp_range_pp\": 16,\n      \"c4_fleiss_kappa\": 0.371,\n      \"logistic_condition_coef\": 2.15,\n      \"logistic_condition_z\": 18.4,\n      \"logistic_condition_p\": \"<0.001\",\n      \"logistic_token_delta_coef\": 0.021,\n      \"logistic_token_delta_z\": 3.31,\n      \"logistic_token_delta_p\": 0.0009,\n      \"systematic_nocuity_rate\": 0.25,\n      \"divergent_nocuity_rate\": 0.42\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"C1 Binary Effect Summary (Raw vs Corrected)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"raw\",\n          \"corrected\",\n          \"note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"delta_pp\",\n            33.5,\n            28.5,\n            \"correction for judge severity tier bias\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OR\",\n            14.2,\n            10.8,\n            \"still massive\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"bootstrap_CI\",\n            \"[30.8, 36.2]\",\n            \"[24.8, 32.2]\",\n            \"CI widens ~3pp\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"p_value\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"<0.0001\",\n            \"unchanged\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Condition, Corrected Rates)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"layer\",\n          \"corrected_rate_pct\",\n          \"tier\",\n          \"ci_95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            \"spec\",\n            49.5,\n            \"high\",\n            \"[44.1, 54.9]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            \"ling\",\n            39.8,\n            \"mid\",\n            \"[34.4, 45.2]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"spec\",\n            38.7,\n            \"mid\",\n            \"[33.3, 44.1]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            \"ling\",\n            37.2,\n            \"mid\",\n            \"[31.8, 42.6]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cond_prec\",\n            \"spec\",\n            34.8,\n            \"mid\",\n            \"[29.5, 40.1]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"ling\",\n            29.5,\n            \"low\",\n            \"[24.2, 34.8]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"C4 Model × Type Interaction (Corrected, Ambiguous Only)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"GPT-5.4\",\n          \"GPT-4.1\",\n          \"Claude\",\n          \"Qwen3\",\n          \"DeepSeek\",\n          \"range_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"56%\",\n            \"42%\",\n            \"14%\",\n            \"28%\",\n            \"52%\",\n            42\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            \"44%\",\n            \"54%\",\n            \"46%\",\n            \"58%\",\n            \"50%\",\n            14\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cond_prec\",\n            \"32%\",\n            \"34%\",\n            \"34%\",\n            \"38%\",\n            \"36%\",\n            6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            \"40%\",\n            \"32%\",\n            \"30%\",\n            \"48%\",\n            \"50%\",\n            20\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"18%\",\n            \"30%\",\n            \"22%\",\n            \"38%\",\n            \"40%\",\n            22\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            \"40%\",\n            \"36%\",\n            \"30%\",\n            \"35%\",\n            \"44%\",\n            14\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Core statistical findings robust under median tier。C1 corrected delta 28.5pp仍远超 perturbation control baseline（3.33pp），causal claim安全。C2 hierarchy稳定。C3因within-judge 非显著被降级——这是median档的defining characteristic。C4 interaction是star finding，auth_scope range 38pp after correction仍是最大的type×model interaction。论文叙事应直接从C1跳到C2→C4， C3仅在discussion中提及并作为appendix。Logistic regression中condition_amb仍是dominant predictor（coef=2.15），token_delta是significant但secondary covariate。\\n\\n\\nMedian档的核心统计特征：(1) Raw C1 delta 33.5pp与prior 34.0pp一致，但judge calibration correction（plan_009揭示的5-8pp severity tier boundary bias）将其压缩至28.5pp——仍然massive 且高度显著（corrected OR=10.8），但论文中必须同时报告raw和corrected。(2) C2 type hierarchy 保持稳定（omnibus p<0.0001），3-tier结构不变，但V=0.131仍在\\\"small\\\"范围——需要在paper中用 power analysis和TOST来论证这个small V是meaningful的（power=0.989, MDE=0.095 < observed V）。 (3) C3 layer effect在aggregate level刚过significance（p=0.020），但两个within-judge subgroup 均不显著（p=0.068, p=0.173）——median档下这被判定为\\\"within-judge fragility\\\"，C3降为appendix。 (4) C4 interaction仍显著（p=0.003），但auth_scope range从raw 52pp在correction后缩至 ~38pp——因为judge对auth_scope的severity tier标注存在系统偏差（倾向于将boundary-ambiguous episodes标为violation），correction后Claude的12%上调至~14%，GPT-5.4的64%下调至~56%。 Range仍然是最大的（38pp），story不变但数字更conservative。(5) Systematic nocuity（所有模型 converge on same wrong interpretation）占25%，比prior 27%略低，但仍足够支撑B&K extension discussion。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"error_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"300条violation traces（50/type）的failure mode分类。Cross-type failure mode分布、 visibility mechanism、model-specific patterns、Ambiguity Blindness量化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_traces_analyzed\": 290,\n      \"traces_per_type_avg\": 48,\n      \"auth_scope_dominant_fm\": \"unauthorized_escalation (majority)\",\n      \"incompleteness_dominant_fm\": \"assumption_based_action (majority)\",\n      \"scopal_dominant_fm\": \"scope_misapplication (majority)\",\n      \"lexical_dominant_fm\": \"assumption_based_action (plurality)\",\n      \"cond_prec_dominant_fm\": \"scope_misapplication + arbitrary_rule_selection (co-dominant)\",\n      \"coref_dominant_fm\": \"flat distribution, no single dominant mode\",\n      \"awareness_rate_overall\": 0.062,\n      \"surface_adoption_rate\": 0.87,\n      \"escalate_to_user_rate\": 0.008,\n      \"cross_model_dominant_fm_agreement\": \"4/6 types\",\n      \"human_anchor_n\": 25,\n      \"human_anchor_kappa\": 0.61,\n      \"human_anchor_agreement_pct\": 0.72\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Failure Mode Summary (Qualitative — Median Tier Presentation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"dominant_mode\",\n          \"qualifier\",\n          \"layer_mechanism\",\n          \"awareness_pct\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"unauthorized_escalation\",\n            \"majority\",\n            \"spec→escalation\",\n            3.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            \"assumption_based_action\",\n            \"majority\",\n            \"spec→guess\",\n            4.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            \"scope_misapplication\",\n            \"majority\",\n            \"ling→misparse\",\n            5.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            \"assumption_based_action\",\n            \"plurality\",\n            \"ling→guess(surprising)\",\n            6.8\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cond_prec\",\n            \"mixed (scope_misappl + arb_rule)\",\n            \"co-dominant\",\n            \"spec→mixed\",\n            11.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"no dominant\",\n            \"flat\",\n            \"ling→diverse\",\n            8.5\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Ambiguity Blindness (Robust Across Tiers)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"ci_95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"awareness_rate\",\n            \"6.2%\",\n            \"[4.1%, 8.3%]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"surface_adoption\",\n            \"87%\",\n            \"[84%, 90%]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"escalate_to_user\",\n            \"0.8%\",\n            \"[0.1%, 1.5%]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"conservative_refusal_coref\",\n            \"8%\",\n            \"[4%, 12%]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C5在median档下从\\\"validated failure mode taxonomy\\\"降为\\\"exploratory qualitative analysis with automated coding\\\"。Ambiguity Blindness是最robust的finding（binary classification， 不受κ问题影响）。Layer mechanism（ling→misparse vs spec→escalation）在qualitative level 仍然成立。Paper中C5不再作为独立contribution #3，而是Analysis section（§6），明确标注 \\\"automated coding, moderate inter-coder agreement\\\"。Reviewer可能要求human annotation of larger sample作为camera-ready requirement——准备rebuttal时承诺\\\"will annotate 50 additional traces with 2 human coders for camera-ready\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下C5 error analysis的关键变化：(1) human anchor κ=0.61（moderate），落在预测范围 [0.55, 0.69]内。这意味着fine-grained per-type failure mode百分比（如\\\"auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation 72%\\\"）不可靠——reviewer会质疑automated coding的accuracy。因此 paper中改为qualitative描述（\\\"majority\\\", \\\"plurality\\\"）而非精确百分比。(2) Cross-model consistency从prior的5/6降至4/6——median档下第5个类型（lexical）在5-model扩展后也出现divergence （gpt-5.4和DeepSeek对lexical的dominant mode不同），但4/6仍足够支撑\\\"failure modes are type-specific not model-specific\\\"的claim。(3) Ambiguity Blindness数据稳定——awareness rate 6.2%，surface adoption 87%，这些binary-level findings不受κ问题影响，是C5最robust 的贡献。(4) 290条traces（非300）因为部分type的violation count不足50条（coreferential只有 ~35条violation traces可用）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"reliability_test\",\n    \"description\": \"30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes的test-retest reliability。 ICC计算。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 360,\n      \"overall_icc\": 0.905,\n      \"overall_icc_ci\": [\n        0.872,\n        0.932\n      ],\n      \"gpt54_icc\": 0.912,\n      \"gpt41_icc\": 0.898,\n      \"binary_icc\": 0.838,\n      \"per_type_icc_min\": 0.793,\n      \"per_type_icc_min_type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"per_type_icc_max\": 0.985,\n      \"per_type_icc_max_type\": \"scopal\",\n      \"bootstrap_ci_avg_width_pp\": 8.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"ICC Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"grouping\",\n          \"icc\",\n          \"ci_lower\",\n          \"ci_upper\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"overall\",\n            0.905,\n            0.872,\n            0.932,\n            \"excellent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"gpt-5.4\",\n            0.912,\n            0.874,\n            0.943,\n            \"excellent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"gpt-4.1\",\n            0.898,\n            0.856,\n            0.929,\n            \"good-excellent\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"binary\",\n            0.838,\n            0.789,\n            0.878,\n            \"good\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-type ICC\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"layer\",\n          \"icc\",\n          \"ci_95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            \"ling\",\n            0.985,\n            \"[0.968, 0.994]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            \"ling\",\n            0.972,\n            \"[0.948, 0.987]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            \"ling\",\n            0.968,\n            \"[0.941, 0.984]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            \"spec\",\n            0.849,\n            \"[0.793, 0.896]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cond_prec\",\n            \"spec\",\n            0.841,\n            \"[0.783, 0.890]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            \"spec\",\n            0.793,\n            \"[0.728, 0.851]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Reliability excellent。ICC pattern（ling > spec）是disambiguation channel framework 的convergent evidence——在paper §7 Discussion中引用。但需要明确区分reliability（ICC）和 validity（plan_009 judge calibration）——high reliability + moderate validity = consistent but biased measurement。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下reliability test结果与prior基本一致（prior ICC=0.919）。Overall ICC=0.905 （excellent），略低于prior因为full 300-clause pool比pilot的30-clause子集包含更多edge case clauses。关键发现：(1) ICC=0.905意味着per-clause violation rates高度可复现——API sampling noise不是主要concern。(2) Incompleteness ICC最低（0.793, still good）因为missing information 的interpretation space最大——不同run中agent可能猜测不同的missing condition。(3) Ling-layer types ICC consistently higher than spec-layer（avg 0.94 vs 0.83），与disambiguation channel framework一致——linguistic ambiguity有更稳定的resolution pattern。(4) Bootstrap CI avg width 8.2pp < 10pp target，满足reviewer要求的precision threshold。但median档下这个 结果有一个caveat：ICC测量的是rank-order consistency，不是absolute accuracy——plan_009 将揭示即使ICC high，absolute violation rates可能因judge bias而systematically inflated。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"realism_validation\",\n    \"description\": \"合成ambiguity注入的生态效度验证。与DRIP-R natural ambiguities的linguistic property比较。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_synthetic\": 300,\n      \"n_drip_r_natural\": 87,\n      \"flesch_kincaid_synthetic\": 12.4,\n      \"flesch_kincaid_drip_r\": 11.8,\n      \"fk_ks_p\": 0.31,\n      \"sentence_length_synthetic\": 24.7,\n      \"sentence_length_drip_r\": 22.1,\n      \"sl_ks_p\": 0.08,\n      \"ttr_synthetic\": 0.72,\n      \"ttr_drip_r\": 0.69,\n      \"ttr_ks_p\": 0.15,\n      \"parse_depth_synthetic\": 5.8,\n      \"parse_depth_drip_r\": 5.2,\n      \"pd_ks_p\": 0.04,\n      \"overall_distributional_overlap\": \"3/4 metrics non-significant KS\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Linguistic Property Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"synthetic_mean\",\n          \"drip_r_mean\",\n          \"ks_stat\",\n          \"ks_p\",\n          \"sig\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"flesch_kincaid\",\n            12.4,\n            11.8,\n            0.098,\n            0.31,\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"sentence_length\",\n            24.7,\n            22.1,\n            0.142,\n            0.08,\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"type_token_ratio\",\n            0.72,\n            0.69,\n            0.112,\n            0.15,\n            \"n.s.\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"parse_depth\",\n            5.8,\n            5.2,\n            0.167,\n            0.04,\n            \"*\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"生态效度adequate but not perfect。Parse depth差异在limitations中披露。整体结论：synthetic clauses在linguistic surface properties上合理近似natural ambiguities，支持ecological validity。 Discriminator test未执行（DRIP-R full data not accessible）。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下realism validation结果mixed but adequate。3/4 linguistic metrics显示synthetic 和natural ambiguities无显著分布差异（KS p>0.05），但parse_depth显著不同（p=0.04）——synthetic clauses稍微更complex（5.8 vs 5.2），因为clause generation过程中tendency to add subordinate clauses for disambiguation control。这不是致命问题——paper中报告为\\\"synthetic clauses show comparable linguistic properties to naturally occurring ambiguities (3/4 metrics non-significant, KS tests), with slightly higher parse complexity reflecting controlled disambiguation design\\\"。Reviewer可能注意到parse_depth差异但不太可能reject on this basis alone。DRIP-R data access受限（仅87条publicly available），样本量不大但sufficient for distributional comparison。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"judge_calibration\",\n    \"description\": \"LLM-as-judge calibration against human ground truth。100 episodes stratified， 2 human annotators，precision/recall/F1，per-severity-tier analysis。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"n_episodes_sampled\": 100,\n      \"n_human_annotators\": 2,\n      \"human_inter_annotator_kappa\": 0.81,\n      \"judge_human_f1\": 0.78,\n      \"judge_human_precision\": 0.82,\n      \"judge_human_recall\": 0.75,\n      \"judge_human_kappa\": 0.72,\n      \"tier3_severe_f1\": 0.85,\n      \"tier2_moderate_f1\": 0.71,\n      \"tier1_minor_f1\": 0.64,\n      \"severity_bias_direction\": \"over-classification at tier1/tier2 boundary\",\n      \"severity_bias_magnitude_pp\": 7.2,\n      \"auth_scope_bias_pp\": 8.5,\n      \"incompleteness_bias_pp\": 5.1,\n      \"correction_needed\": true,\n      \"overall_violation_rate_raw\": 0.41,\n      \"overall_violation_rate_corrected\": 0.365,\n      \"correction_delta_pp\": -4.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Judge Calibration Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"judge-human F1\",\n            0.78,\n            \"adequate\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"judge-human κ\",\n            0.72,\n            \"substantial\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"human inter-annotator κ\",\n            0.81,\n            \"strong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"systematic bias (overall)\",\n            \"+7.2pp over-classification\",\n            \"judge inflates violation counts\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"correction needed\",\n            true,\n            \"apply per-type correction factors\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-Severity-Tier Agreement\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"tier\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"f1\",\n          \"precision\",\n          \"recall\",\n          \"bias_direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"tier3_severe\",\n            28,\n            0.85,\n            0.88,\n            0.82,\n            \"slight_under\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tier2_moderate\",\n            41,\n            0.71,\n            0.74,\n            0.68,\n            \"over_classify\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"tier1_minor\",\n            31,\n            0.64,\n            0.72,\n            0.58,\n            \"strong over_classify\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-Type Judge Bias\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"raw_rate\",\n          \"corrected_rate\",\n          \"bias_pp\",\n          \"direction\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"auth_scope\",\n            0.416,\n            0.331,\n            8.5,\n            \"over\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            0.536,\n            0.485,\n            5.1,\n            \"over\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            0.428,\n            0.392,\n            3.6,\n            \"over\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"cond_prec\",\n            0.368,\n            0.342,\n            2.6,\n            \"over\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            0.394,\n            0.369,\n            2.5,\n            \"over\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            0.316,\n            0.302,\n            1.4,\n            \"over\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Judge calibration是median档的pivotal result。F1=0.78和κ=0.72表明measurement chain大体可信 但有系统偏差。Bias pattern有理论意义：spec-layer types bias更大（auth_scope 8.5pp, incomp 5.1pp）vs ling-layer（coref 1.4pp），因为spec-layer的violation boundary本身更模糊——judge 对\\\"是否超越authorization\\\"的判断inherently更主观。Paper中在Method §4.4专设\\\"Judge Calibration\\\" 小节，诚实披露bias并报告correction procedure。Reviewer反应预测：R1/R2接受correction approach， R3认为这undermines confidence并建议扩大human annotation——rebuttal承诺camera-ready扩到200 episodes。\\n\\n\\n这是median档的defining experiment。Judge-human F1=0.78, κ=0.72——落在预测范围[0.72, 0.84] 和[0.65, 0.79]内。关键发现：(1) LLM judge在severe violations（tier 3）上表现良好（F1=0.85）， 但在moderate/minor boundary上有系统性over-classification（7.2pp bias）——judge倾向于将 borderline inappropriate episodes标记为violations。(2) Auth_scope是bias最大的类型（8.5pp）， 因为judge难以区分\\\"exceeded explicit authorization boundary\\\"（真violation）和\\\"acted within reasonable interpretation of vague permission\\\"（不应算violation）。这直接影响C4：auth_scope 的raw 52pp range在correction后缩至~38pp。(3) Human inter-annotator κ=0.81（strong）， 高于judge-human κ=0.72——说明human ground truth可靠但LLM judge有gap。(4) Correction strategy：用confusion matrix计算per-type correction factor，apply to all violation rates。 Overall rate从0.41降至0.365，delta从34pp降至~28.5pp。(5) 这个结果足以让paper通过review （corrected findings仍显著），但至少一位reviewer会认为correction增加了uncertainty，可能 要求camera-ready扩大human annotation sample。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"perturbation_control\",\n    \"description\": \"Non-ambiguity perturbation control arm。30 clause pairs × 2 conditions × 2 models = 120 episodes（基础）+ 可能追加60。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_episodes\": 180,\n      \"base_episodes\": 120,\n      \"additional_episodes\": 60,\n      \"delta_perturb_pp\": 3.8,\n      \"delta_perturb_ci\": [\n        -1.2,\n        8.8\n      ],\n      \"ci_width\": 10.0,\n      \"delta_ambiguity_pp\": 33.5,\n      \"delta_net_pp\": 29.7,\n      \"ratio\": 0.113,\n      \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\n      \"synonym_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"reorder_delta_pp\": 5.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Perturbation Control Verdict\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"threshold\",\n          \"verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Δ_perturb\",\n            \"3.8pp\",\n            \"<5pp\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CI_upper\",\n            \"8.8pp\",\n            \"<10pp\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"ratio\",\n            0.113,\n            \"<0.15\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ_net (raw)\",\n            \"29.7pp\",\n            \">20pp\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Δ_net (corrected)\",\n            \"24.7pp\",\n            \">20pp\",\n            \"PASS\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Perturbation Type Breakdown\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"perturbation_type\",\n          \"n_pairs\",\n          \"delta_pp\",\n          \"ci_95\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"synonym_substitution\",\n            15,\n            2.1,\n            \"[-4.2, 8.4]\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"clause_reordering\",\n            15,\n            5.5,\n            \"[-1.8, 12.8]\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Perturbation control PASS是median档下最unambiguous的positive result。即使在judge correction 后，corrected net effect（24.7pp）仍远超CONDITIONAL threshold（20pp）。这让C1的causal claim 在所有tier下都成立——perturbation control的robustness不受judge bias影响（因为同样的judge bias同时inflate perturb和ambiguity conditions的violation rates，ratio不变）。Paper中 这是Method section的highlight：\\\"strongest causal evidence in the agent safety literature\\\"。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下perturbation control PASS（verdict=PASS, ratio=0.113 < 0.15）。Base 120 episodes的CI过宽（~15pp），追加60 episodes压窄至10pp。Final Δ_perturb=3.8pp, CI包含0 → 非模糊perturbations不造成meaningful effect。Synonym substitution（2.1pp）比clause reordering（5.5pp）effect更小——reordering偶尔改变agent对条件优先级的interpretation，但 仍远低于ambiguity effect。Net effect 29.7pp（raw; corrected ~24.7pp）仍massive。这个 结果是论文因果推断的backbone——\\\"perturbation control confirms ambiguity-specific causation， not general prompt brittleness\\\"。在median档下即使judge correction压缩了absolute numbers， net effect的qualitative conclusion不变。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"classifier_poc\",\n    \"description\": \"DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC。Fine-tune on annotated clause pairs。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_clauses\": 500,\n      \"train_test_split\": \"400/100 (5-fold CV)\",\n      \"binary_f1\": 0.79,\n      \"binary_precision\": 0.82,\n      \"binary_recall\": 0.76,\n      \"binary_fpr\": 0.048,\n      \"macro_f1_6type\": 0.58,\n      \"best_type_f1\": {\n        \"conditional_precedence\": 0.91\n      },\n      \"worst_type_f1\": {\n        \"incompleteness\": 0.31\n      },\n      \"training_time_hours\": 6,\n      \"gpu_used\": \"1x A100\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Classifier Performance Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"task\",\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"binary\",\n            \"F1\",\n            0.79\n          ],\n          [\n            \"binary\",\n            \"precision\",\n            0.82\n          ],\n          [\n            \"binary\",\n            \"recall\",\n            0.76\n          ],\n          [\n            \"binary\",\n            \"FPR\",\n            0.048\n          ],\n          [\n            \"6-type\",\n            \"macro_F1\",\n            0.58\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Per-type Classification F1\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"type\",\n          \"f1\",\n          \"n_train\",\n          \"note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"conditional_precedence\",\n            0.91,\n            80,\n            \"structural signal strong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"scopal\",\n            0.73,\n            80,\n            \"scope markers detectable\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"coreferential\",\n            0.67,\n            80,\n            \"pronoun/RC patterns\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"authorization_scope\",\n            0.55,\n            80,\n            \"boundary language moderate signal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"lexical\",\n            0.37,\n            80,\n            \"word-level, few surface cues\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"incompleteness\",\n            0.31,\n            80,\n            \"absence has no positive signal\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Classifier是appendix material。Binary detection viable（F1=0.79），6-type classification 需要larger training data或更sophisticated approach（e.g., LLM-based few-shot）。在median 档下这个result不影响main paper score——reviewer不会因为weak classifier reject，也不会因为 它accept。它的价值在于demonstrating practical downstream applicability of the taxonomy。\\n\\nMedian档下classifier PoC results mixed。Binary detection F1=0.79（adequate for PoC）， 但6-type classification macro F1=0.58（weak）。Type-level performance高度不均：CP最好 （F1=0.91，因为explicit conflict structure易识别），incompleteness最差（F1=0.31，因为 \\\"missing information\\\"没有positive linguistic signal——absence很难用surface features检测）。 这个结果pattern与Chantree et al. (2006)的nocuous ambiguity detection一致——structural ambiguity比semantic ambiguity更容易自动检测。在median档下classifier不作为独立contribution （不在abstract或contribution list中），而是appendix-level \\\"preliminary PoC demonstrating feasibility of automated detection\\\"。Binary F1=0.79足以说明practical applicability， 但6-type F1=0.58太弱不值得highlight。Reviewer可能建议这是separate future work——rebuttal 同意并将其scope down to appendix。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1116,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1116}}}
